{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2722730/extras/fishtemp.png?t=1746203969\" /><strong><br>Desktank</strong> is a cozy idle aquarium that lives right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Inspired by the charm of idle games like <i>Rusty\u2019s Retirement</i>, Desktank brings a peaceful underwater world to your screen \u2014 whether you\u2019re working, browsing, or just taking a break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You decide how you want to experience it:<br>\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Keep it tucked in the corner like a cute screen companion,<br>\ud83c\udf0a Or let it float freely across your whole desktop for a full aquarium takeover.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc1f Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle Aquarium Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Fish swim, grow, and interact while you focus on other things.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Desktop Integration</strong> \u2013 Always-on-top mode lets your tank float over your workspace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customize Your Fish</strong> \u2013 Change fish colors and styles to create your perfect underwater vibe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic Ecosystem</strong> \u2013 Watch your tank come alive with fish behaviors and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Peaceful &amp; Non-Intrusive</strong> \u2013 No stress, no pressure \u2014 just ambient chill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fully Customizable View</strong> \u2013 Resize, position, and theme your aquarium to match your mood.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722730?t=1746203969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2722730?t=1746203969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app